(7642131, 1241050, 101668, '<td valign="top">So much for aftermath! Our farm burned down last night! Now we can do aftermath! Thanks to all my supporters, think I have one more scene for free study, then this will be over. We pray for rain, especially now. Did shoot some but as usual, I am in too much of a panic to think images. Fortunately, the homestead was never in danger and everything looks better in the morning.</td>', 'So much for aftermath! Our farm burned down last night! Now we can do aftermath! Thanks to all my supporters, think I have one more scene for free study, then this will be over. We pray for rain, especially now. Did shoot some but as usual, I am in too much of a panic to think images. Fortunately, the homestead was never in danger and everything looks better in the morning.', '2019-09-23 02:01:06.000000', NULL, 0),
